        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 18SB, Heavy Duty Solid Brass 18\" Surface Slide Bolts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDecorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in an array of different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 18 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-18SB.gif?v=1704354749\" width=\"600\" height=\"159\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 18SB 18 Inch Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-6sb\"><b>Deltana 6SB 6\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-8sb\"><b>Deltana 8SB 8\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-12sb\"><b>Deltana 12SB 12\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-24-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-24sb\"><b>Deltana 24SB 24\" Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 18SB 18 Inch Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Width of Guides: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Includes 3 Strikes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/18SB.pdf?v=1691095268\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 18SB 18\" Surface Bolts Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 18 Inch Surface Bolt",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass 18 Inch Surface Slide Bolts, Deltana 18SB - Decorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in an array of different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 18 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.",
                "keywords": "DEL-18SB 18 Inch Surface Bolts, deltana  surface bolts, decorative door bolts, surface mounted door bolts, bolt deltana 184SB  surface bolts heavy duty solid brass, 18 inch door bolt, deltana 18 inch Surface Bolts, DEL-18SB3 18 inches Surface Bolts, door slide bolts, 18 inch slidebolts, DEL-18SB10B, DEL-18SB15, DEL-18SB15A, DEL-18SB19, DEL-18SB26, DEL-18SB26D, DEL-18SB3-UNL, DEL-18SB5, DEL-18SB003,"
